{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick A Round</strong> is a game that brings the nostalgia of childhood to life. Who doesn't remember the joy of wandering outdoors, searching for the coolest sticks? Maybe we secretly still do. A combination of playful chaos and relaxing moments. Whether you want to go on an adventure, collect the best sticks, or challenge your friends to epic duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f4e71bd791839329bbdfa7a5168175b0.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f4e71bd791839329bbdfa7a5168175b0.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f4e71bd791839329bbdfa7a5168175b0.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stick Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random generation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stick you find is uniquely yours! Our procedural generation creates infinite, naturally realistic stick combinations, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/58954ef76fc5675eaa5a5482119325aa.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/58954ef76fc5675eaa5a5482119325aa.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/58954ef76fc5675eaa5a5482119325aa.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover truly unique sticks with special variations! Find rare sticks adorned with beautiful flowers, vibrant leaves, sharp thorns, or even curious mushrooms, making each find a personal treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/df52ce435909ccb4d8c640166b77f0ee.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/df52ce435909ccb4d8c640166b77f0ee.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/df52ce435909ccb4d8c640166b77f0ee.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world in different season! Each seasons has  a different vibe and different stick variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/4aeaa1d32f213134f544611d00f217ce.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/4aeaa1d32f213134f544611d00f217ce.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/4aeaa1d32f213134f544611d00f217ce.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Ragdolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for hilariously chaotic stick fights! Watch your friends ragdoll and tumble as you beat them in combat. Every unique stick offers distinct advantages, so choose wisely to dominate the playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8690cc7addd3e8b93115115cf8d4644.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8690cc7addd3e8b93115115cf8d4644.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8690cc7addd3e8b93115115cf8d4644.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer &amp; proximity chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join public or private lobbies to play with friends or meet new ones. Engage in hilarious proximity chat as you hunt for legendary sticks, battle it out in epic group fights, or unwind with fun mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore as different characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/042aa3e30c99efa05784b0ee5c55092f.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/042aa3e30c99efa05784b0ee5c55092f.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/042aa3e30c99efa05784b0ee5c55092f.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between cool cosmetics to set yourself apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/06525ec5c1da7543df3a03ae4d9514e7.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/06525ec5c1da7543df3a03ae4d9514e7.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/06525ec5c1da7543df3a03ae4d9514e7.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favourite color and apply it on your character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/deaf73ff9f682d3989e40f481c716890.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/deaf73ff9f682d3989e40f481c716890.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/deaf73ff9f682d3989e40f481c716890.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built alongside an amazing community who shares childhood memories and suggests new ideas. While the core vision stays true to the original concept, every suggestion helps make the world richer and more nostalgic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Stick Generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly and welcoming community</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866080?t=1757860807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866080?t=1757860807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/ca785ec40d80a7724138bfda87176d36cee91fa8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757860807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/ca785ec40d80a7724138bfda87176d36cee91fa8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757860807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick A Round</strong> is a game that brings the nostalgia of childhood to life. Who doesn't remember the joy of wandering outdoors, searching for the coolest sticks? Maybe we secretly still do. A combination of playful chaos and relaxing moments. Whether you want to go on an adventure, collect the best sticks, or challenge your friends to epic duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f4e71bd791839329bbdfa7a5168175b0.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f4e71bd791839329bbdfa7a5168175b0.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f4e71bd791839329bbdfa7a5168175b0.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stick Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random generation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stick you find is uniquely yours! Our procedural generation creates infinite, naturally realistic stick combinations, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/58954ef76fc5675eaa5a5482119325aa.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/58954ef76fc5675eaa5a5482119325aa.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/58954ef76fc5675eaa5a5482119325aa.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover truly unique sticks with special variations! Find rare sticks adorned with beautiful flowers, vibrant leaves, sharp thorns, or even curious mushrooms, making each find a personal treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/df52ce435909ccb4d8c640166b77f0ee.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/df52ce435909ccb4d8c640166b77f0ee.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/df52ce435909ccb4d8c640166b77f0ee.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world in different season! Each seasons has  a different vibe and different stick variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/4aeaa1d32f213134f544611d00f217ce.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/4aeaa1d32f213134f544611d00f217ce.webm?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/4aeaa1d32f213134f544611d00f217ce.mp4?t=1757860807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Ragdolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for hilariously chaotic stick fights! Watch your friends ragdoll and tumble as you beat them in combat. Every unique stick offers distinct advantages, so choose wisely to dominate the playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8690cc7addd3e8b93115115cf8d4644.poster.avif?t=1757860807\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/ext